2026-Apr-27 01:17:14.450228 INFO [firewallet] Commands: 
  address              Show current wallet public address
  balance              Show current wallet balance
  burn                 burn <amount> - Create a HEAT burn (0.8, 8, 80, 800 TEST)
  burn_info            burn_info <id> - Get detailed info of burn by ID
  cold                 cold <amount> <term_code> - Create a Certificate of Ledger Deposit (0.8, 8, 80, 800 TEST with terms 3 (3months) or 12 (1yr)
  cold_info            cold_info <id> - Get detailed info on your Certificate of Ledger Deposits
  complete_swap        complete_swap <adaptor_secret> <peer_partial_sig> <tx_prefix_hash> - Complete swap with revealed adaptor secret
  create_cold_secret   create_cold_secret <amount> <term_blocks> <chain_code> <metadata> - Create COLD commitment
  create_integrated    create_integrated <payment_id> - Create an integrated address with a payment ID
  elderking_ceremony   elderking_ceremony - (DEPRECATED)
  exit                 Close wallet
  export_keys          Show the secret keys of the current wallet
  gen_new_sub          gen_new_sub [major] [minor] - Generate a sub-address at index (major, minor). Omit args for auto-increment (0, N).
  gen_proof            gen_proof <tx_hash> - Data needed to generate STARK proof for deposit transaction (for L2 claims)
  get_reserve_proof    all|<amount> [<message>] - Generate a signature proving that you own at least <amount>, optionally with a challenge string <message>. 
  get_tx_proof         Generate a signature to prove payment: <txid> <address> [<txkey>]
  height               Show blockchain height
  help                 Show this help
  incoming_transfers   Show incoming transfers
  initiate_swap        initiate_swap <amount> <peer_pubkey> <pair> [role] - Start adaptor-sig atomic swap (Musig2 escrow)
  list_aliases         list_aliases - List all registered TEST aliases on the network
  list_burns           list_burns - List all burn transactions.
  list_cold            list_cold - List all COLD yield deposits
  list_subs            list_subs - List all sub-addresses for this wallet
  list_transfers       list_transfers <block_height> - Show all known transfers, optionally from a certain block height
  lookup_alias         lookup_alias <alias_or_address> - Look up a TEST alias by name or wallet address
  migrate_cold         migrate_cold <id> - Migrate a pre-v3 legacy deposit to v3 format (register commitment for L2 claims)
  optimize             Combine many available outputs into a few by sending a transaction to self
  optimize_all         Optimize your wallet several times so you can send large transactions
  outputs              Show the number of unlocked outputs available for a transaction
  payment_id           Generate random Payment ID
  payments             payments <payment_id_1> [<payment_id_2> ... <payment_id_N>] - Show payments <payment_id_1>, ... <payment_id_N>
  refund_swap          refund_swap <peer_partial_sig> <tx_prefix_hash> - Cooperative refund of Musig2 escrow
  register_alias       register_alias <alias> - Register a TEST alias (8 chars ONLY: [A-Z0-9] (CAPS-LOCK) req'd, [a-z0-9] (lowercase) for regular user wallets)
  reset                Discard cache data and start synchronizing from the start
  save                 Save wallet synchronized data
  set_log              set_log <level> - Change current log level, <level> is a number 0-4
  show_dust            Show the number of unmixable dust outputs
  sign_message         Sign a message with your wallet keys
  start_mining         start_mining [<threads>] - Start mining to your wallet
  stop_mining          stop_mining - Stop mining
  swap                 swap - Launch swapxfg testnet swap terminal
  transfer             transfer <addr_1> <amount_1> [<addr_2> <amount_2> ... <addr_N> <amount_N>] [-p payment_id] [-m message] - Transfer <amount_1>,... <amount_N> to <address_1>,... <address_N>, respectively. 
  unstake              unstake - (DEPRECATED)
  verify_signature     Verify a signed message
  withdraw             withdraw <id> - Withdraw a deposit
  

